    "turn_text": "You know, I am just so proud to be part of this class. You know, it's one of the most diverse classes in the history of the United States and of the Congress. When I look around the tables of my colleagues, you see just the face of our nation. There's myself, the first Filipino American. from California in the Congress. There's my friends that the first two Native American members are Congress, two Muslim women members, African Americans, Latinx, and so on. What you look around is the face of America and it's beautiful.",
