  {
    "episode_id": 44607,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/4/4/44607.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 12,
    "turn_text": "On this show, we want to praise the people who simplify and make healthcare more affordable just as much as we praise those scientists who come up with important, if complex breakthroughs. And I really believe that making healthcare more affordable, more simple, more accessible is actually the fundamental responsibility of our generation. I suppose I have to ask this question, but do you support Medicare for all?",
