      },
      {
        "text": "Prescription drug prices need to be reduced.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Some great legislation has already been passed to reduce prescription drug prices.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Rural healthcare access can be expanded using modern technology.",
