    "turn_text": "That's really important work. And I guess underpinning some of this as well as your position on some of the health services that are under threat and on a shot in the arm, we feel very strongly about access to reproductive health services. And I was thinking to myself, how was I going to ask you this question? I thought, oh, you know, just ask it. So TJ, what is your position on your position on access to safe abortion?",
