        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "Global health challenges like AIDS, TB, and malaria are significant threats requiring coordinated action.",
        "confidence": 0.86
      },
      {
        "text": "Publicly expressing support for global health enhances credibility and leadership.",
