  {
    "episode_id": 44607,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/4/4/44607.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 25,
    "turn_text": "Well, you know, certainly one of the great opportunities there is telehealth. All right. And so that's, you know, telehealth is you can reach anybody anywhere. And so it's the access of of high-speed broadband to all of these countries. And certainly, once again, as I was saying, rural communities throughout the California are the areas that I represent to villages in Ghana or Zambia or Zimbabwe and throughout Africa and Asia and all around the world. That's something that we can do very, very cheaply. The technology is there. And there's investments that we should be making.",
